### Health (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8087/healthz

### Service manifest (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8087/

### Give an agent a browser task
POST http://localhost:8087/browse
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task": "Find the cheapest flight to Tokyo next month",
  "return": "structured"
}

### Poll the job (paste the id from the POST response)
GET http://localhost:8087/browse/PASTE_JOB_ID
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
